---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---

<BaseLayout title="Transparent Pricing" description="Honest, simple pricing for senior living facilities. Free self-hosted open-source or fully managed HIPAA-ready cloud.">
  <section class="py-20 bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900/80 to-slate-950">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-16">
        <div class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-blue-950/80 border border-blue-800/60 rounded-full text-blue-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
          Simple, Transparent Pricing
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-display font-black text-white tracking-tight mb-6">
          Priced for Independent Facilities, <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-400 to-teal-400">Not Enterprise Monopolies.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-300">
          No $1,200/month surprise invoices, no mandatory hardware leases, and zero vendor lock-in.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Pricing Cards Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-6xl mx-auto mb-16">
        <!-- Tier 1: Starter -->
        <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="text-slate-400 font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Starter</div>
            <div class="text-3xl font-display font-black text-white mb-2">$199 <span class="text-base text-slate-400 font-normal">/ mo</span></div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-6">Ideal for small Assisted Living or Memory Care homes under 35 beds.</p>
            
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs text-slate-300 border-t border-slate-800 pt-6 mb-8">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-teal-400 font-bold">✓</span> Up to 35 Resident Profiles</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-teal-400 font-bold">✓</span> Kitchen Tablet Mode</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-teal-400 font-bold">✓</span> High-Contrast Tray Card Printing</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-teal-400 font-bold">✓</span> Weekly Menu Cycle Planner</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-teal-400 font-bold">✓</span> Standing Order Guide & Par Levels</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <a href="http://localhost:3000" class="w-full py-3 text-center bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-white font-bold rounded-xl text-sm transition-all">
            Start 30-Day Pilot
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Tier 2: Professional -->
        <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-blue-950/40 border-2 border-blue-500 flex flex-col justify-between relative shadow-2xl shadow-blue-500/10">
          <div class="absolute -top-3.5 right-6 px-3 py-1 bg-blue-600 text-white text-[11px] font-black uppercase tracking-wider rounded-full shadow-md">
            Most Popular
          </div>

          <div>
            <div class="text-blue-400 font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Professional</div>
            <div class="text-3xl font-display font-black text-white mb-2">$399 <span class="text-base text-slate-400 font-normal">/ mo</span></div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 mb-6">For standard facilities (36–90 beds) running daily production and distributor ordering.</p>
            
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs text-slate-200 border-t border-blue-900/60 pt-6 mb-8">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-teal-400 font-bold">✓</span> Up to 90 Resident Profiles</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-teal-400 font-bold">✓</span> <strong>Dennis Food Service CSV Auto-Sync</strong></li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-teal-400 font-bold">✓</span> <strong>Cost Per Resident Day ($/CPD) Auditing</strong></li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-teal-400 font-bold">✓</span> Smart Recipe Allergen Auto-Detection</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-teal-400 font-bold">✓</span> 10-Tier Multi-User RBAC & Audit Logs</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-teal-400 font-bold">✓</span> Signed Business Associate Agreement (BAA)</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <a href="http://localhost:3000" class="w-full py-3 text-center bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white font-bold rounded-xl text-sm transition-all shadow-lg shadow-blue-600/30">
            Start 30-Day Pilot
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Tier 3: Enterprise -->
        <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="text-slate-400 font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">Enterprise / Multi-Unit</div>
            <div class="text-3xl font-display font-black text-white mb-2">$699 <span class="text-base text-slate-400 font-normal">/ mo</span></div>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mb-6">For campuses (90+ beds) or regional operators managing multiple buildings.</p>
            
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs text-slate-300 border-t border-slate-800 pt-6 mb-8">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-teal-400 font-bold">✓</span> Unlimited Resident Profiles</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-teal-400 font-bold">✓</span> Custom Food Distributor Integrations</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-teal-400 font-bold">✓</span> Automated Cloud Backup & 30-Day Retention</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-teal-400 font-bold">✓</span> Priority 4-Hour Response SLA</li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-teal-400 font-bold">✓</span> Dedicated Account Manager</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <a href="mailto:support@shorelineops.com" class="w-full py-3 text-center bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-white font-bold rounded-xl text-sm transition-all">
            Contact Sales
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Open Source / Self-Hosted Callout -->
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 text-center">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Want to self-host for free?</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-4">
          ShorelineOps is 100% open-source under the MIT license. You can clone the repository, run our Docker Compose stack, and self-host on your own servers without paying us a cent.
        </p>
        <a href="https://github.com/ShadowWalkerNC/ShorelineOps" class="text-blue-400 font-bold text-sm hover:underline">
          View Docker Compose & Deployment Documentation &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
